Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.70,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"Kapag pumatay ka ng weasel... kukunin ba nito kaluluwa mo?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:42.70,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang kamag-anak ng weasel, buhay kapalit buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:02.12,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapag nasilayan mo ang weasel,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:04.33,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kukunin nito ang buhay mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:07.94,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Depende — sadya ba o aksidente?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:08.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ano'ng kaibahan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:10.10,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kung aksidente,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.46,S_fil,,0,0,0,,magsunog ka ng offering at mag sorry — okay na.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.74,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pero dapat totoo ang pagsisisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pero kung sadya,'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:16.04,S_fil,,0,0,0,,buhay kapalit buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:18.68,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit may boses ng ibang tao sa utak ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:20.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bukas ang lahat ng passage ng katawan natin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.56,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapag humawak ang spirit sa isang passage,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at gusto kang kausapin, ganito mangyayari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.92,0:00:25.04,S_fil,,0,0,0,,'Yan ang heart-sense. May eye-sense at ear-sense pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.04,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Para makipag-usap sa kanila,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,dadasal ka na lang sa isip mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.68,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Huwag mong ihalo ang sariling isip,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.72,0:00:29.84,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kundi, hindi magiging tama ang readings mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.64,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang eye-sense ay yin-yang eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang ear-sense, nakikinig sa spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.12,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Magpapakita't papakinggin ka nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.08,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Depende lahat sa master mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:38.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Paano ko malalaman kung aling spirit ang nagsasalita?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:39.16,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Fox, weasel, ghost immortals —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:40.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,iba-iba ang pakiramdam pag humawak sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.70,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Matututuhan mo rin 'yan.
